OL,5,G0810 Sunday Worship
OL,6,     FAs the city fills with performers,
OL,7,     FFather Philip Blackledge looks at
OL,8,     Fadopting different personas and
OL,9,     Fhiding behind masks. With music by
OL,10,     Fmembers of Edinburgh Festival
OL,11,     FChorus.
OL,12,G0848 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1993, the Irish writer Roddy
OL,14,     FDoyle won the prestigious Booker
OL,15,     FPrize for fiction. His novel,
OL,16,     FPaddy Clarke Ha Ha Ha, portrayed
OL,17,     Flife through the eyes of a
OL,18,     F10-year-old boy.
OL,19,G0858 Tweet of the Day
OL,20,     FAuthor and science communicator
OL,21,     FSophie Pavelle on why the skylark
OL,22,     Fis an iconic avian muse.
